        </svg>
      </a>

      <!-- Nav pill: 1053×68, white, radius 100 -->
      <div class="nav-pill">

        <!-- Links: Hearing Grows Here, Tinnitus, About ▾, Missions, Research -->
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="#">Hearing Grows Here</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Tinnitus</a></li>
          <li>
            <a href="#" aria-haspopup="true">
              About
              <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 11 7" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="1,1 5.5,6 10,1"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li><a href="#">Missions</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Research</a></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Phone + CTA -->
        <div class="nav-right">
          <a href="tel:8472951185" class="nav-phone" aria-label="Call us">
            <svg class="phone-icon" viewBox="0 0 14 23" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="1" y="1" width="12" height="21" rx="2" stroke="#00B2E4" stroke-width="1.4"/>
              <circle cx="7" cy="18.5" r="1.2" fill="#00B2E4"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="nav-phone-num">(847) 295-1185</span>
          </a>

          <a href="#" class="btn-schedule" role="button">
            <span class="btn-schedule-text">Schedule a consultation</span>
            <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M5 12H19" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M14 7L19 12L14 17" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

</div>
</div>
<div class="snap-section">
<div class="s2-outer">

  <!-- Circle: always wider than viewport, positioned in outer -->
  <div class="s2-bg-circle"></div>

  <!-- Photos: positioned relative to outer (100vw), vw-sized — bleed off edges -->
  <div class="s2-photo s2-photo-tl">
    <img src="/s2-photo-top.png" alt="People dancing joyfully" />
  </div>
  <div class="s2-photo s2-photo-tr">
    <img src="/s2-circle.png" alt="Child with headphones" />
  </div>
  <div class="s2-photo s2-photo-bl">
    <img src="/s2-photo-left.png" alt="Hands playing piano" />
  </div>
  <div class="s2-photo s2-photo-br">
    <img src="/s2-photo-right.png" alt="Grandparent and child" />
  </div>

  <!-- Canvas: 1554px centered — center content at Figma coords -->
  <div class="s2-canvas">

    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <p class="s2-eyebrow">Treating Hearing From the Inside Out</p>

    <!-- Heading -->
    <h2 class="s2-heading">
      Hearing is the
      <em>most</em> intensive task
      your brain performs.
    </h2>

    <!-- Decorative horizontal line below heading -->
    <div class="s2-h-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Brain + orange concentric rings (Figma export) + CSS pulse rings -->
    <div class="s2-brain" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/s2-brain.png" alt="" />
      <div class="s2-brain-rings">
        <span class="s2-brain-ring"></span>
        <span class="s2-brain-ring"></span>
        <span class="s2-brain-ring"></span>
        <span class="s2-brain-ring"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Vertical dashed lines -->
    <div class="s2-vline-top" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="s2-vline-bottom" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Body text -->
    <p class="s2-body">
      Hearing directly impacts cognitive function, memory, and emotional well-being,
      your auditory system is one of the most complex networks in your body,
      processing up to 30 speech sounds per second.
      <span class="highlight">1000x faster than vision.</span>
    </p>

  </div>

  </div>
</div>
</div>
</div><!-- end snap-section s2 -->

<!-- SECTION 3 — Snap point 3 -->
<div class="snap-section">
<div class="s3-outer" id="s3">
  <div class="s3-frame">
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b1"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b2"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b3"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b4"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble grey  s3-b5"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble grey  s3-b6"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble grey  s3-b7"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b8"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b9"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b10"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b11"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b12"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b13"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b14"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b15"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b16"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b17"></div>
    <div class="s3-bubble cyan  s3-b18"></div>
    <div class="s3-center">
      <img src="/s3-ear.png" alt="Ear icon with concentric rings" />
      <div class="s3-counter" id="s3Counter">32,000</div>
    </div>
    <p class="s3-text" id="s3Text">
      Your 32,000 hearing cells<br>were designed to last<br>a lifetime...
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- SECTION 4 — Snap point 4 -->
<div class="snap-section">
<div class="s4-outer" id="s4">
  <div class="s4-frame">
    <div class="s4-bubble s4-b1"></div>
    <div class="s4-bubble s4-b2"></div>
    <div class="s4-bubble s4-b3"></div>
    <div class="s4-bubble s4-b4"></div>
    <div class="s4-bubble s4-b5"></div>
    <div class="s4-bubble s4-b6"></div>
    <div class="s4-bubble s4-b7"></div>
    <div class="s4-bubble s4-b8"></div>
    <div class="s4-ghost">The Problem</div>
    <p class="s4-headline">They <em>never</em> regrow...</p>
    <div class="s4-brain-area">
      <div class="s4-waves">
        <canvas class="wave-canvas" width="2000" height="200"></canvas>
      </div>
      <div class="s4-brain-circle">
        <img src="/s4-brain-circle.png" alt="Brain icon with concentric rings" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- SECTION 5 — "The Problem" dark variant -->
<div class="snap-section">
<div class="s5-outer" id="s5">
  <div class="s5-frame">
    <div class="s5-bubble s5-b1"></div>
    <div class="s5-bubble s5-b2"></div>
    <div class="s5-bubble s5-b3"></div>
    <div class="s5-bubble s5-b4"></div>
    <div class="s5-bubble s5-b5"></div>
    <div class="s5-bubble s5-b6"></div>
    <div class="s5-bubble s5-b7"></div>
    <div class="s5-bubble s5-b8"></div>
    <div class="s5-ghost">The Problem</div>
    <p class="s5-headline">They <em>never</em> regrow...</p>
    <div class="s5-brain-area">
      <div class="s5-waves"><canvas class="wave-canvas" width="2000" height="200"></canvas></div>
      <div class="s5-brain-circle"><img src="/s4-brain-circle.png" alt="Brain icon" /></div>
    </div>
    <p class="s5-subtext">That's why hearing loss <em>doesn't</em> stay in your ears.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- SECTION 6 — "When hearing fades" -->
<div class="snap-section">
<div class="s6-outer" id="s6">
  <div class="s6-frame">
    <div class="s6-bubble s6-b1"></div>
    <div class="s6-bubble s6-b2"></div>
    <div class="s6-bubble s6-b3"></div>
    <div class="s6-bubble s6-b4"></div>
    <div class="s6-bubble s6-b5"></div>
    <div class="s6-bubble s6-b6"></div>
    <div class="s6-bubble s6-b7"></div>
    <div class="s6-bubble s6-b8"></div>
    <div class="s6-ghost">When hearing fades</div>
    <p class="s6-headline">Your brain <em>compensates</em></p>
    <div class="s6-brain-area">
      <div class="s6-waves"><canvas class="wave-canvas" width="2000" height="200"></canvas></div>
      <div class="s6-brain-circle"><img src="/s4-brain-circle.png" alt="Brain icon" /></div>
    </div>
    <p class="s6-subtext">stealing from <em>memory, focus,</em> and <em>cognition</em> to keep up.</p>
    <div class="s6-stats">
      <p class="s6-stats-header">In fact, recent research shows that untreated hearing loss can</p>
      <div class="s6-stats-divider"></div>
      <div class="s6-stats-items">
        <p class="s6-stats-item">Accelerate cognitive decline by up to <strong>40%</strong></p>
        <p class="s6-stats-item">Increases the risk of dementia by <strong>5x</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- SECTION 7 — "That's why Duet goes beyond..." -->
<div class="snap-section">
<div class="s7-outer" id="s7">
